{"id":"621548","name":"水煎馒头","author":"付贵宝","authorId":"11281978","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/621548/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"馒头","amount":"一个"}],"sub":[{"name":"水淀粉","amount":"一碗"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"准备食材。","img":"images/621548/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"馒头上蒸锅蒸5分钟。","img":"images/621548/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"用食品夹取出馒头装盘。","img":"images/621548/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"馒头切片装盘备用。","img":"images/621548/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"炒锅用刷子刷一层油。","img":"images/621548/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"开小火，油热下馒头片煎。","img":"images/621548/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"用小碗加一勺淀粉、水调成水豆粉。","img":"images/621548/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"一面煎黄翻面煎另一面。","img":"images/621548/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"下水豆粉煎制。","img":"images/621548/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"盖锅盖水煎5分钟。","img":"images/621548/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"加一勺烧烤汁调味。","img":"images/621548/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"出锅装盘。","img":"images/621548/step_12.jpg"}],"tips":"馒头先预热一下。 \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：蒸锅、炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}